  "entity.help.chargerPriority": "When several chargers share the site's fuse, a charger set to First is served before the others and one set to Last gets what is left.",
  "entity.help.phaseSwitching": "When the sun does not cover three-phase charging, charge on one phase instead of drawing from the grid. While this is on, SpotNav sets the charger's phases itself and the charger's own automatic phase mode is not used. Some cars charge badly after a phase change: turn this off if your car stops charging.",
