  "site.activeControl.reason.directionUnknown": "Load balancing cannot tell whether a phase draws from the grid or exports. It still lowers the car on an overload and raises it again within the room the measured current leaves, but cannot count export on a phase as room. Turn on \u201CGrid current is signed\u201D and choose the total grid power, or press Use on your meter under Found in Home Assistant.",
  "site.activeControl.reason.directionUnknownUsePower": "Load balancing cannot tell whether a phase draws from the grid or exports. It still lowers the car on an overload and raises it again within the room the measured current leaves, but cannot count export on a phase as room. Your meter also reports power per phase, which gives the direction: press Use on your meter under Found in Home Assistant.",
